## API Endpoints Reference

### 1. POST `/api/college/create_policy`

Create a new placement policy rule for a specific passout year.

**Headers:** `Authorization: Bearer <token>`

**Request Body:**
```json
{
    "passout_year": 2025,
    "policy_title": "Maximum Offer Acceptance Limit",
    "policy_description": "Each student is allowed to accept a maximum of 2 placement offers. Additional offers must be declined."
}
```

**Success Response (201):**
```json
{
    "success": true,
    "message": "Placement policy created",
    "data": {
        "policy_id": "a1b2c3d4-...",
        "college_id": "...",
        "passout_year": 2025,
        "policy_title": "Maximum Offer Acceptance Limit",
        "policy_description": "Each student is allowed to accept a maximum of 2 placement offers. Additional offers must be declined.",
        "is_active": true,
        "created_by": "...",
        "created_at": "2026-03-06T...",
        "updated_at": "2026-03-06T..."
    }
}
```

**Error Responses:**
| Status | Condition |
|--------|-----------|
| 409 | Duplicate title for same college + passout year |
| 400 | Joi validation failure |

---

### 2. GET `/api/college/get_all_policies`

List all policies with optional filters, search, sorting, and pagination.

**Query Parameters:**

| Param | Type | Default | Description |
|-------|------|---------|-------------|
| `passout_year` | number | — | Filter by year |
| `is_active` | `"true"` / `"false"` | — | Filter by status |
| `search` | string | — | Search in title & description |
| `sort_by` | `created_at` / `policy_title` / `passout_year` / `updated_at` | `created_at` | Sort column |
| `sort_order` | `asc` / `desc` | `desc` | Sort direction |
| `page` | number | 1 | Page number |
| `limit` | number | 10 | Records per page (max 100) |

**Example:** `GET /api/college/get_all_policies?passout_year=2025&is_active=true&page=1&limit=10`

**Success Response (200):**
```json
{
    "success": true,
    "message": "Placement policies retrieved successfully",
    "data": {
        "policies": [
            {
                "policy_id": "...",
                "passout_year": 2025,
                "policy_title": "Maximum Offer Acceptance Limit",
                "policy_description": "Each student is allowed to accept...",
                "is_active": true,
                "created_by": "...",
                "created_at": "...",
                "updated_at": "...",
                "created_by_name": "Dr. Admin"
            }
        ],
        "summary": {
            "total_policies": "5",
            "active_count": "4",
            "inactive_count": "1",
            "year_count": "2"
        }
    },
    "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 10,
        "total": 4,
        "totalPages": 1
    }
}
```

