## Frontend Implementation Guide

### Policy Management Page

#### Form Fields (Create / Edit Policy)

| Field | Input Type | Required | Validation |
|-------|-----------|----------|------------|
| Passout Year | **Dropdown** (populated from college's configured years, e.g. 2024–2030) | ✅ | Integer, 2000–2100 |
| Policy Title | **Single-line input** | ✅ | 2–200 chars, trimmed |
| Policy Description | **Textarea** (4–6 rows) | ✅ | 2–2000 chars, trimmed |

#### List Page Features

| Feature | Implementation |
|---------|---------------|
| **Year filter** | Dropdown — load distinct years or use college's default academic year |
| **Status filter** | Toggle/Dropdown — "All", "Active", "Inactive" |
| **Search** | Text input — debounce 300ms, searches title + description |
| **Sort** | Clickable column headers: Title, Year, Created Date |
| **Pagination** | Standard page controls, default 10 per page |
| **Status badge** | Green "Active" / Red "Inactive" |
| **Summary cards** | Show `total_policies`, `active_count`, `inactive_count`, `year_count` from response |

#### Actions per Policy Row

| Action | UI Element | API Call |
|--------|-----------|----------|
| View | Click row / eye icon | `GET /get_policy/:id` |
| Edit | Pencil icon | Opens edit form → `PUT /update_policy/:id` |
| Toggle | Switch/toggle | `PATCH /toggle_policy_status/:id` |
| Delete | Trash icon + confirm modal | `DELETE /delete_policy/:id` |

