## Edge Case Test Scenarios

| # | Scenario | Expected Result |
|---|----------|----------------|
| 1 | Create policy with duplicate title (same year) | `409` — "A policy with this title already exists for passout year 2025" |
| 2 | Same title but different year | `201` — Created successfully (distinct years allowed) |
| 3 | Update title to conflict with another policy | `409` — Duplicate check on update |
| 4 | Update with empty body `{}` | `400` — "At least one field must be provided" |
| 5 | Toggle already-active to `is_active: true` | `400` — "Policy is already active" |
| 6 | Toggle already-inactive to `is_active: false` | `400` — "Policy is already inactive" |
| 7 | Delete non-existent policy ID | `404` — "Placement policy not found" |
| 8 | Access policy from another college | `404` — college_id isolation |
| 9 | List with no filters | Returns all policies for the college |
| 10 | Search with partial match | ILIKE match on title + description |
| 11 | Very long title (>200 chars) | `400` — Joi validation |
| 12 | `passout_year` below 2000 or above 2100 | `400` — Joi validation |
| 13 | Missing required fields on create | `400` — Joi validation with specific message |

