## Integration with Existing & Future APIs

### Existing Integrations

| Related Module | Relationship |
|---------------|-------------|
| **Placement Results** ([placement.service.js](file:///c:/Users/Gopal%20Bharat%20Patil/OneDrive/Desktop/placement-crm-api/src/services/college/placement.service.js)) | When creating placements, policies for the student's passout year can be fetched to **enforce rules** (e.g., max offers). Currently informational; can be automated later. |
| **Student Restrictions** (`restriction.service.js`) | Policies like "offer rejection penalty" can trigger auto-creation of restrictions via future automation hooks. |
| **Job Postings** | Policies are **per passout_year** — same filter used by jobs, applications, and placements. |

### Future Integration Points

| Future Module | How Policies Integrate |
|--------------|----------------------|
| **Student Job Apply** | Before application, fetch active policies → display to students → enforce programmatic rules |
| **Dashboard / Analytics** | Show policy counts by year, active vs inactive display |
| **Notification System** | When a new policy is created → auto-notify students of that passout_year |

### Data Flow

```
College Admin creates policies per passout_year
    ↓
Policies displayed to students on job application page (informational)
    ↓
Enforcement hooks in placement creation check policy rules
    ↓
Violations trigger student restrictions
```

### Frontend Navigation

```
Dashboard → Placement Policies (sidebar)
    → List Page (filter by year, status)
        → Create Policy (modal or separate page)
        → Edit Policy (modal or separate page)
        → Toggle Active/Inactive (inline switch)
        → Delete Policy (confirm dialog)
```
